{"name":"Deco Grey","hex":"#89978e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"deco","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Decompression."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A friendship book in which people add decorative elements such as drawings, stickers and sequins.","Clipping of decoration."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/deco"},{"term":"grey","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Commonwealth standard spelling of gray.","Synonym of coloured (pertaining to the mixed race of black and white)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["Commonwealth standard spelling of gray."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/grey"}],"entries":[{"title":"Deco","blocks":[{"text":"Anderson Luís de Souza, also known as Deco, is a former professional footballer who primarily played as an attacking or central midfielder. Born and raised in Brazil, he played for the Portugal national team. He currently works as sporting director for Barcelona. Deco is widely considered one of the best midfielders of his generation."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Deco_com_o_Fluminense_em_2013_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Deco"},{"title":"Grey","blocks":[{"text":"Grey or gray is an intermediate color between black and white. It is a neutral or achromatic color, meaning that it has no chroma. It is the color of a rain or storm cloud, of ash, and of lead."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Loxodonta_africana_by_Ron_Cogswell.jpg/330px-Loxodonta_africana_by_Ron_Cogswell.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grey"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/df/Deco_21dec2006.jpg/330px-Deco_21dec2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org